e; unexercised options are not deducted, so the value can be somewhat high.","This is a model of your assumptions, not investment advice or a price target.","Credit spreads: ICE BofA US corporate option-adjusted spreads (FRED); synthetic rating from Damodaran’s interest-coverage table for large firms."],"sources":[{"label":"Microsoft 10-K FY2026 (filed 2026-07-29)","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/789019/000119312526323660/0001193125-26-323660-index.htm"},{"label":"Yahoo Finance share price","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/"},{"label":"FRED DGS10: 10-year US Treasury yield (2026-11-12)","url":"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/DGS10"},{"label":"U.S. Treasury daily par yield curve","url":"https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/TextView?type=daily_treasury_yield_curve"},{"label":"Damodaran Online (NYU Stern): implied ERP, country risk premiums, industry averages (US)","url":"https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~adamodar/New_Home_Page/datacurrent.html"},{"label":"SEC XBRL frames: Revenues and OperatingIncomeLoss, all filers","url":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/sec-api-documentation"},{"label":"ICE BofA US corporate option-adjusted spreads by rating (FRED)","url":"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/BAMLC0A4CBBB"}],"warnings":[],"inputs":{"growth_pct":14.5719,"ebit_margin_pct":45.6824,"terminal_pct":3.0,"wacc_pct":9.42952,"rf_pct":5.1,"erp_pct":4.23,"value_per_share":186.15,"price":523.88,"price_date":"2026-11-13","range_low":152.11,"range_high":240.766,"model":{"base_revenue_m":331839.0,"growth_pct":[14.57,12.26,9.94,7.63,5.31],"ebit_margin_pct":45.68,"tax_pct":18.42,"da_pct":8.12,"capex_pct":25.33,"nwc_pct":8.99332,"wacc_pct":9.42952,"terminal_pct":3.0,"debt_m":40294.0,"minority_m":0.0,"cash_m":20935.0,"shares_m":7426.19,"price":523.88,"first_year":"FY2027"}},"asof":"2026-11-15","disclaimer":"Educational analysis of reported SEC data and historical prices; not investment advice.","highlights":[{"label":"Model value per share","v